# Application specific
*.log
preferences.config
preferences.json
# imgui rewrites this every session, so a tracked copy is pure churn. Kept
# consistent with preferences.json above: both are per-user session state, not
# project source. A canonical default layout, if ever wanted, ships as
# default_imgui.ini the way Reference/ does.
imgui.ini

# Generated run artifacts. Same rationale as imgui.ini: written by a run, not
# authored. documents/ holds capture sequences whose embeddings run to hundreds
# of megabytes, past GitHub's 100MB per-file limit, and the *.ini files here are
# per-run scratch configs rather than the project's own settings.
*.npz
documents/
Fluoddity_pilot.ini
UMAP____captures.ini
gui_frame_test.ini
